<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>3 Months of Us ❤️</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;background:#080808;color:#fff;overflow:hidden}
.page{display:none;min-height:100vh;padding:34px 24px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%,#32121d 0,#12090d 38%,#050505 75%)}
.page.active{display:flex;animation:fade .55s ease} .card{width:min(680px,100%);padding:28px;border:1px solid #ffffff22;border-radius:28px;background:#ffffff0c;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:0 20px 70px #0008}
h1{font-size:clamp(34px,8vw,62px);margin:8px 0 14px} h2{font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,46px);margin:8px 0 18px}
p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#eee} .big{font-size:clamp(46px,12vw,88px);font-weight:800} .muted{color:#bbb}
button,input{font:inherit} button{border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;margin:8px;background:#fff;color:#111;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer} button.alt{background:#ffffff18;color:#fff;border:1px solid #ffffff30}
.nav{position:fixed;bottom:18px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;z-index:5} .dots{position:fixed;top:15px;right:18px;color:#bbb;font-size:13px;z-index:5}
.photo{width:min(420px,90vw);max-height:58vh;object-fit:cover;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid #ffffff25;box-shadow:0 16px 50px #000}
.quote{font-size:22px;font-weight:600} .letter{text-align:left;max-height:65vh;overflow:auto;padding-right:5px}
input{width:min(320px,90%);padding:14px 18px;border-radius:15px;border:1px solid #ffffff30;background:#0008;color:#fff;text-align:center;outline:none}
.quiz{text-align:left} .q{padding:15px;margin:10px 0;border:1px solid #ffffff18;border-radius:18px;background:#ffffff08} .q b{display:block;margin-bottom:8px} select{width:100%;padding:11px;border-radius:12px;background:#111;color:#fff;border:1px solid #ffffff25}
.pop{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#0008;z-index:20} .pop.show{display:flex} .popbox{font-size:75px;animation:shake .45s ease}
.success{font-size:25px;margin-top:12px;min-height:32px;color:#ffd9e2}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@keyframes shake{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}25%{transform:translateX(-14px)}50%{transform:translateX(14px)}75%{transform:translateX(-8px)}}
.heart{font-size:48px;animation:pulse 1.2s infinite} @keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.12)}}
small{color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="dots" id="dots"></div>

<section class="page active"><div class="card"><div class="heart">❤️</div><h2>How Many Days?</h2><div class="big">92</div><p>Days of Us</p><p class="quote">“92 days, countless memories, and one person who makes every day special.” 🫶🏻</p></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><div class="heart">⏳</div><h2>How Many Hours?</h2><div class="big">2,208</div><p>Hours of Us</p><p class="quote">“And every hour became a little more special because of you.” ❤️</p></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><div class="heart">⏳</div><h2>How Many Minutes?</h2><div class="big">132,480</div><p>Minutes of Us</p><p class="quote">“And somehow, I still want every next minute with you.” 🫶🏻</p></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><div class="heart">⏳</div><h2>How Many Seconds?</h2><div class="big">7,948,800</div><p>Seconds of Us</p><p class="quote">“And every single second with you is precious.” ❤️</p></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><h2>Our Photo ❤️📸</h2><img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our photo"><p>One picture. So many feelings. 🥹</p></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><h2>A Few Flirty Lines 😏❤️</h2>
<p>“Tum meri favourite notification ho… tumhe dekhte hi smile automatically aa jaati hai. 🫣❤️”</p>
<p>“3 months ho gaye, par tumpe crush abhi bhi first day jaisa hai. 😭🫶🏻”</p>
<p>“Tum itni cute kyun ho? Meri concentration ki toh band baja rakhi hai. 😂❤️”</p>
<p>“Tum saamne hoti ho toh words kam pad jaate hain… aur tum door hoti ho toh tumhari yaad. 🫣💕”</p></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><h2>Special Application 💌</h2><div class="letter">
<p><b>To,</b><br>Meri favourite person,<br><b>Bhawna ❤️</b></p>
<p><b>Subject: Tumhare saath aur zyada time spend karne ki application 🥹</b></p>
<p>Respected Madam,</p>
<p>Bade hi pyaar aur respect ke saath main ye application submit kar raha hoon ki <b>humare 3 months complete ho gaye hain</b>, aur honestly mujhe abhi bhi lagta hai ki ye time itni jaldi kaise nikal gaya. 🥹❤️</p>
<p>Main maanta hoon ki main perfect nahi hoon, kabhi-kabhi mujhse mistakes bhi hoti hain, but <b>tumhare liye meri feelings aur care hamesha genuine hain.</b> 🫶🏻</p>
<p>Isliye meri humble si request hai ki meri application ko approve karke mujhe <b>tumhare saath aur bahut saare months, memories, fights, hasi-mazaak aur beautiful moments</b> spend karne ka permission diya jaye. 😭❤️</p>
<p><b>Yours lovingly,<br>Daksh ❤️</b><br><small>Permanent applicant for “Bhawna ke saath forever”</small></p>
</div></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><h2>Only You Can Unlock This… 🔐</h2><p>Humari story ki woh date enter karo jis din sab kuch start hua tha… ❤️</p>
<input id="code" placeholder="DDMMYYYY" maxlength="8"><br><button onclick="checkCode()">Unlock 🔓</button><div class="success" id="codeMsg"></div></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card quiz"><h2>How Well Do You Know Me? 🫣❤️</h2><p>Chalo Bhawna, ab dekhte hain tum apne Daksh ko kitna jaanti ho… 👀❤️</p>
<div class="q"><b>1. 🎨 Mera favourite colour kya hai?</b><select data-a="black"><option value="">Choose</option><option>Black</option><option>White</option><option>Blue</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>2. ❤️ Meri favourite cheez kya hai?</b><select data-a="bhawna/mein"><option value="">Choose</option><option>Bhawna/mein</option><option>Music</option><option>Food</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>3. 🫶🏻 Mujhe tumhare saath kya karna pasand hai?</b><select data-a="dono"><option value="">Choose</option><option>Kiss</option><option>Hug</option><option>Dono</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>4. 📱 Maine tumhara naam Instagram par kaise rakha hai?</b><select data-a="rasmalai"><option value="">Choose</option><option>Rasmalai</option><option>Princess</option><option>Baby</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>5. 🏔️ Mujhe tumhare saath kahan jaana hai?</b><select data-a="kedarnath"><option value="">Choose</option><option>Kedarnath</option><option>Manali</option><option>Goa</option></select></div>
<div class="q"><b>6. 🥹 Mujhe sabse zyada pyaar kis cheez se hai?</b><select data-a="bhawna"><option value="">Choose</option><option>Bhawna</option><option>Gaming</option><option>Music</option></select></div>
<button onclick="checkQuiz()">Submit Answers ❤️</button><div class="success" id="quizMsg"></div></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><h2>Just One Last Thing… ❤️</h2><div class="letter">
<p><b>Bhawna,</b></p>
<p>Mujhe tumse <b>bahut zyada pyaar hai</b>… shayad jitna main words mein kabhi properly explain bhi nahi kar paunga. 🥹❤️</p>
<p>Ye 3 months mere liye sirf 3 months nahi hain. Ye <b>92 days, 2,208 hours, 132,480 minutes aur 7,948,800 seconds</b> hain jo meri life ki beautiful memories ban chuke hain. 🫶🏻</p>
<p>Tum meri life ka woh person ho jiske saath main apni happiness share karna chahta hoon, apni silly baatein karna chahta hoon, hasna chahta hoon aur naye-naye memories banana chahta hoon. ❤️</p>
<p>Kabhi humari chhoti si fight ho, kabhi misunderstanding ho, ya kabhi mood off ho — main bas itna chahta hoon ki <b>hum ek dusre ko chhodne ke bajaye ek dusre ko samajhne ki koshish karein.</b> 🥺</p>
<p><b>Thank you meri life mein aane ke liye, mujhe samajhne ke liye, meri stupid baatein tolerate karne ke liye aur meri favourite person banne ke liye.</b> ❤️</p>
<p><b>Happy 3 Months, meri Rasmalai 🍬❤️</b></p><p><i>I love you so, so, so much. 🥹🫶🏻</i></p><p><b>— Yours, Daksh ❤️</b></p>
</div></div></section>

<section class="page"><div class="card"><h2>One Last Request… 🥹❤️</h2>
<p class="quote">Agar tumhe ye website pasand aayi ho… toh mujhe ek <b>hug 🤗</b> dena banta hai!</p>
<p> Aur agar tum comfortable ho… ek cute sa <b>kiss 😘</b> bhi? 🫣❤️</p>
<p><b>No pressure, madam! 😂</b><br>Bas tumhari smile hi mere liye enough hai. 🫶🏻</p>
<button onclick="alert('🤗 Hug accepted! ❤️')">🤗 HUG</button>
<button class="alt" onclick="alert('😘 Cute! Only if you are comfortable ❤️')">😘 KISS</button>
<p><small>Thank you for being my favourite person. ❤️</small></p></div></section>

<div class="pop" id="pop"><div class="popbox">🥺😭</div></div>
<div class="nav"><button class="alt" onclick="prev()">← Back</button><button onclick="next()">Next →</button></div>

<script>
let i=0,pages=document.querySelectorAll('.page');
function show(n){i=Math.max(0,Math.min(pages.length-1,n));pages.forEach((p,k)=>p.classList.toggle('active',k===i));document.getElementById('dots').textContent=(i+1)+' / '+pages.length;}
function next(){show(i+1)} function prev(){show(i-1)}
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='ArrowRight')next();if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')prev();});
function crying(){let p=document.getElementById('pop');p.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>p.classList.remove('show'),700);}
function checkCode(){let v=document.getElementById('code').value.trim();let m=document.getElementById('codeMsg');if(v==='16062026'){m.textContent='Access Granted! 🥹❤️ Meri sabse special secret toh tum khud ho. 🫶🏻';}else{m.textContent='Wrong code…';crying();}}
function checkQuiz(){let ok=true;document.querySelectorAll('.quiz select').forEach(s=>{if(s.value.toLowerCase()!==s.dataset.a)ok=false;});let m=document.getElementById('quizMsg');if(ok){m.textContent='All correct! 🥹❤️ Tum mujhe sach mein jaanti ho!';}else{m.textContent='Oops… ek ya kuch answers galat hain. 🥺😭';crying();}}
show(0);
</script>
</body>
</html>
